  "note": "Writes hand-checked-case.json for px4_pos: two local position ticks worked out from MulticopterPositionControl::Run (MulticopterPositionControl.cpp:376-623), PositionControl (PositionControl.cpp) and ControlMath (ControlMath.cpp), PX4's default parameters except COM_THROW_EN = 1 (takeoff skipped: armed means TakeoffState::flight, Takeoff.cpp:104-106). Inputs at both ticks: a valid estimate at rest at the origin (heading 0, vxy_max = inf); control mode armed with multicopter position control, stamped 1 s; airborne land detector; a trajectory setpoint of zero velocity only (position, acceleration, yaw, yawspeed NaN), stamped 1 s. Step 0 (t = 1 s): dt = constrain((1 s - 0) * 1e-6, 0.002, 0.04) = 0.04. Velocity error 0, integral 0, derivative 0, so acc_sp = 0 (:161); body_z = (-0, -0, g) normalized = (0, 0, 1), no tilt; thrust_ned_z = 0 * (0.5 / g) - 0.5 = -0.5; collective = min(-0.5 / 1, -max(MPC_THR_MIN 0.12, 1e-3)) = -0.5; thr_sp = (-0, -0, -0.5), inside every saturation. bodyzToAttitude((0, 0, 0.5), yaw = heading 0) is the identity; thrust_body[2] = -|thr_sp| = -0.5; yawspeed NaN -> 0 (:146). Local position setpoint: position NaN, velocity 0, acceleration 0, thrust (-0, -0, -0.5), yaw 0. Takeoff status: state 5 (flight), tilt limit slewed from 0 at 0.2 rad/s: 0.2f * 0.04f = 0.008. Step 1 (t = 1.0025 s): dt = 0.0025; the same setpoints; tilt limit 0.008 + 0.2f * 0.0025f, which changed, so takeoff_status is published again.",
